From fe89a597f3c8a52f18c92d13e751e7e2b7ea3739 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starbite <starbite@local>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:33:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0401-port-7195-build-fixes.patch

- pmap.c: declare the compilation-service cdhash lock/buffer and pmap_cs_log_hacks the public 7195 source uses but does not define
- kalloc.h, IOLib.h, vm_kern.h: 8796 names kalloc_data/kfree_data, IOMallocData/IOMallocZeroData/IOFreeData, KMA_DATA
- prng_random.c (0014): SWEET HMAC DRBG keeps its state outside 7195's Fortuna-shaped cckprng_ctx; 7195's init signature
- IOHIDEventServiceUserClient (0058): classic IOUserClient dispatch instead of IOUserClient2022
- kern_exit.c (0044): launchd_exit_reason_get_string_desc; exception.c: include kern/kalloc.h
- MASTER.arm64.starlte: no pgtrace
- libkern, bsd Makefile.template: trailing space after the per-object INCFLAGS (7195's config tool joins them to the source path)
- sweet_amfi.c (0025/0035): no AMFI interface (libkern/amfi/amfi.h) on 7195, which parses XML entitlements itself; the MAC policies stay
- machine_routines.c: ml_enable_monitor and ml_io_map_unmappable for SWEET boards; pmap.c: pmap_cs_allow_invalid (closed/stripped in public 7195)
- lldbmacros syntax_checker.py: Python 3 no-op (7195's is Python 2)
---
 bsd/conf/Makefile.template                    |  3 +-
 bsd/kern/kern_exit.c                          |  2 +-
 bsd/kern/sweet_amfi.c                         | 11 ++++
 config/MASTER.arm64.starlte                   |  4 +-
 iokit/IOKit/IOLib.h                           |  5 ++
 .../arm/hid/IOHIDEventServiceUserClient.cpp   | 34 +++++-----
 .../arm/hid/IOHIDEventServiceUserClient.h     | 11 ++--
 libkern/conf/Makefile.template                |  3 +-
 osfmk/arm/pmap.c                              | 17 +++++
 osfmk/arm64/machine_routines.c                | 21 +++++++
 osfmk/kern/exception.c                        |  1 +
 osfmk/kern/kalloc.h                           |  6 ++
 osfmk/prng/prng_random.c                      | 43 ++++++++-----
 osfmk/vm/vm_kern.h                            |  1 +
 tools/lldbmacros/core/syntax_checker.py       | 63 ++-----------------
 15 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 100 deletions(-)

